[options]
[A.]
<$PlaySound,PriestStruggleFade01.wav>
<$PlaySound,PriestStruggleFade03.wav>
                                                     <h2>Rampage of Rain City<a href="#mission13">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                                                  ~[Ipriest.62]      ~[Ianim.43]<br>
                               ~[Ipriest.55]        ~[Ipriest.96]     ~[IrainFactory.6]  ~[Ianim.17]    <br>
                                    ~[Ipriest.57]                                               ~[Ipriest.48]         ~[Ipriest.26]
<br>
After you invaded Windy City and spilt the blood of the Ambassador of Wind<br>
Hades is sending you into Rain City so as to capture the Ambassador of Rain<br>
so he can learn the knowledge of the Rain Fury.
 <p>
You must Rampage the entire Rain City and spare no priest.<br>
Sacrifice them all in the name of Hades.<br>
Then earn the knowledge of the Rain once the ambassador is dead.
<p>
                             <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                                  <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                                    <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
                <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Your Knowledge</a>                        <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Plunder!</a>                         <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">Leave mission</a>
<$Tell,sound1>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,GolemMove5.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A.

[sound1]
<$Config,sw_soundFlag=0>
<$PlaySound,thunderCannonImpact.wav>
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound2
[sound2]
<$Config,sw_soundFlag=1>
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound3
[sound3]
<$Config,sw_soundFlag=0>
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound4
[sound4]
<$Config,sw_soundFlag=1>
<$PlaySound,PriestSacrifice2.wav>
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound5
[sound5]
<$Config,sw_soundFlag=0>
<$PlaySound,thunderCannonImpact.wav>
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound6
[sound6]
<$Config,sw_soundFlag=1>
<$PlaySound,PriestSacrifice4.wav>
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound7
[sound7]
<$Config,sw_soundFlag=0>
$Timeout=0,Tell,sound8
[sound8]
<$PlaySound,thunderCannonImpact.wav>
<$PlaySound,PriestStruggleFade03.wav>

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god5}</h2>
<p>
My Ambassador is dead. Don't let another of my men die.
$Button=I fight harder Mastah!,DoNothing,0

[ai8PriestCaptured]
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god5}</h2>
<p>
<i>You have captured that miserable Ambassador. Sacrifice him in my name.
With the power of rain, you will learn the power of Regeneration:</i>
$Menu=~[IrainBlocker.*]~yIce Tower,GetTechnology,147
<$MoveDialog,tr>
$Button=I don't want Gifts. I want to ALLY with Rain,Tell,AllianceBegun
$Timeout=25,Tell,AllianceWithdrawn

[AllianceBegun]
<$Config,sw_m13=0>
<$Config,sw_m14=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=6000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=3>
<$Config,sw_mvar3=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar4=3>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
<$MisionBegin,mission14>

[AllianceWithdrawn]
<$Config,sw_pickally1=0>
<p>You took too long to respond.  The {sw_god5} learned of your attempted betrayal.<br>
He is going to kill you now.
<$Config,sw_m13=0>
<$Config,sw_m24=1>
$Button=No! It's a Mistake! I'M SORRY!,MissionBegin,sw_m24

[NoAlliance]
<$Config,sw_pickally1=0>
$Button=SAC HIM!,DoNothing,0

[ai8PriestDead]
<h2>It is a glorious day, for the Ambassador of Rain City is dead!</h2>
<$Config,sw_enDead8=1>
$OnExit= ,Tell,checkwin
$Button=A moment of joy,DoNothing,0

[ai6PriestCaptured]
<$MoveDialogBox,ml>
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god5}</h2>
<p>
You have captured one of Rain's little toy soldier's. Kill him now!
You need a source of energy for your new found Tech. The
Rain Fury grants you this:
$Menu=~[IrainBattery.*]~yRain Battery,GetTechnology,76

[ai7PriestDead]
A mighty Warrior of Rain has just given his life in the aid of Peace. May his
 blood be on your hands forever.</h2>
<$Config,sw_enDead7=1>
$OnExit= ,Tell,checkwin
$Button=On with it!,DoNothing,0

[ai5PriestDead]
The <i>Cloud Floater</i> is now yours to command!
<$Config,sw_enDead5=1>
$OnExit= ,Tell,checkwin
$Menu=~yCloud Floater~[IrainBalloon.16],GetTechnology,146

[ai6PriestDead]
After killing this warrior, you learn some tricks.
You learn the power of the <i>Rain Cannon</i>
<$Config,sw_enDead6=1>
$OnExit= ,Tell,checkwin
$Menu=~yRain Cannon~[IrainCannon.3],GetTechnology,129

[ai3PriestDead]
One of your allies is dead. You must fight even harder now.
$Button=Lemme at em!,DoNothing,0

[ai4PriestDead]
It is a sad day in Hades<br>
for one of his warriors is dead!
$Button=I'll get revenge!,DoNothing,0

                                                                                         [Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
[checkwin]
<?{sw_enDead8}><?{sw_enDead7}><?{sw_enDead5}>
<?{sw_enDead6}>
                                  <h2>VICTORY!</h2>
                                       ~[IsunCannon.24]<br><br><br><br>
~[IthunderCannon.17]   ~[Ialtar.3]   ~[IthunderCannon.35]<br>
                                       ~[IsunCannon.11]<br>
<p>
                You've killed all of Rain Warriors.<br>
                   May the Furies grant you speed.<br>
                            For you will need it!
<$Config,sw_m13=0>
<$Config,sw_m15=1>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
$Button=To: Destruction of Thunder City,MissionBegin,sw_m15
</?></?></?></?>


[Failed]
Now you will meet Hades for you have failed him once too often!
<$Config,sw_m13=0>
<$Config,sw_m24=1>
$Button=NO! Not HADES ALTAR!,MissionBegin,sw_m24


[END]

